<newsitem itemid="167823" id="root" date="1996-11-05" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Dairy Crest H1 pro forma pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>Dairy Crest H1 pro forma pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept. 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.5		  vs   9.3</p>
<p> Dividend (penc e)	 3.26		 vs   nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     16.5		  vs  15.4</p>
<p> Turnover		  381.6		  vs 365.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Above results are pro forma.</p>
<p>Year-ago turnover includes 9.5 million stg from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 19.3		   vs 17.3</p>
<p> Exceptional charge	0.9		   vs  nil</p>
<p> Interest payable	  1.9		   vs  1.9</p>
<p> Tax			   5.5		   vs  5.1</p>
<p> Net taxed		  11.0		   vs 10.3</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan. 23, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov. 19  Ex-div date		Nov. 11</p>
<p>NOTE: Above earnings per share excludes exceptional items. Including the items, EPS was 9.9p versus 9.3p.</p>
<p>Year-ago operating profit includes 700,000 stg from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The consumer foods and services group was floated in August.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
